# <%= current_page.data.title %>

The CJS Common Platform is a system that has been built from a Domain Driven Design first perspective.

There are a number of [context maps](https://tools.hmcts.net/confluence/display/DDD/Common+Platform+Context+Map)* that
give an overview of the different contexts within the system.

New joiners should read and follow the [onboarding](onboarding/index.html) process to obtain access.

For an orientation to how the platform is put together, the language it uses and where
the authoritative documentation lives, start with [architecture](architecture/index.html).
It links the published [architecture model](https://hmcts.github.io/cp-c4-architecture/).

